# Wrrapd brand icon (canonical)

**Always use** the icon that is live on wrrapd.com (browser tab / home screen): the **rounded red W with the gold bow**. Roger approved it on Oct 4, 2026. Do not use the older blocky "focus" W or the floating-W icon.

| Asset | Path |
|---|---|
| Source of truth | `wordpress/icons/favicon/android-chrome-512x512.png` (byte-identical to live `wp-content/mu-plugins/icons/favicon/android-chrome-512x512.png`) |
| Live tab icons (copied from live, do not regenerate) | `favicon.ico`, `icon-16.png`, `icon-32.png`, `icon-180.png`, `icon-192.png` |
| Other sizes (resized from the source) | `icon-{48,64,96,128,256,512,1024,2048}.png`; `icon-focus-512.png` is kept as a copy of the source for old references |
| Live MU path | `wp-content/mu-plugins/icons/favicon/` |

## Rules for agents

- Favicons, PWA icons, apple-touch icons, PDF covers, admin marks, any square Wrrapd "app icon": use the files above.
- The full wordmark (`Wrrapd_f-Logo-800-x-458-px.png`) is for header/footer **word** branding only.
- If the live files ever change, copy them from live into the repo first, then resize the others from `android-chrome-512x512.png`. Never push repo icons over live ones without comparing checksums.
